    <B><FONT style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times">AMENDED
    AND RESTATED AGREEMENT OF LIMITED PARTNERSHIP<BR>
    OF<BR>
    SQN ALTERNATIVE INVESTMENT FUND&#160;III, L.P.</FONT></B>
